Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["7. Intersections as queues: M/D/1", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"b321bb7d-8933-4fc9-abaa-5b968ed1445d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Continuous flow on a link is only half the story; intersections are where \
vehicles accumulate, and a signalised junction looks exactly like a server \
that alternates between available (green) and unavailable (red). With Poisson \
arrivals at rate ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Lambda]", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "0bac6978-f091-4bf8-aa35-dae34e619d62"],
 " and deterministic service during green at rate ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[Mu]", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "b620060e-b153-4bad-ac29-c5e4989a9cfe"],
 ", the Pollaczek\[Dash]Khinchine formula for the M/D/1 queue gives"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5ed2b5a7-5c7a-4864-a577-667cd6f409b3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["L", "q"], "=", 
   FractionBox[
    SuperscriptBox["\[Rho]", "2"], 
    RowBox[{"2", "(", 
     RowBox[{"1", "-", "\[Rho]"}], ")"}]]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->"e79c6516-ee79-4ae4-9d36-502264140fe3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["W", "q"], "=", 
   FractionBox["\[Rho]", 
    RowBox[{"2", "\[ThinSpace]", "\[Mu]", "\[ThinSpace]", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"1", "-", "\[Rho]"}], ")"}]}]]}], 
  TraditionalForm]], "DisplayFormula",
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->"5f21796c-4463-4024-baca-0138e4059d34"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "both diverging as utilisation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "=", 
    FractionBox["\[Lambda]", "\[Mu]"]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "e2a70b2d-5073-4505-bb05-daadd0185b66"],
 " approaches 1. Deterministic service is optimistic \[LongDash] the more \
general M/G/1 formula scales these by a factor ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"(", "1", "+", 
     SuperscriptBox["C", "2"], ")"}], "/", "2"}], TraditionalForm]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "b6d9a40a-4413-4c3b-88b5-b069cc6b542e"],
 " where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["C", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "53d8770e-e35f-497d-932e-cd3bb69d4e1c"],
 " is the coefficient of variation of the service time. For deterministic \
service ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"C", 
    RowBox[{"=", "0"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "84bd182c-e44c-4118-8ab4-4e80bbd79c8d"],
 ", halving the result; for exponential (M/M/1) ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"C", 
    RowBox[{"=", "1"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "deb55523-6608-445e-a0d0-3b61936d60ed"],
 " doubles it. So M/D/1 is the lower bound \[LongDash] real intersections are \
worse."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1b8918ce-102c-42b1-923c-2cd71f6e612e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Traffic engineers read the practical threshold ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"\[Rho]", 
    RowBox[{"=", "0.85"}]}], TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "ab9ff47f-245e-4975-b1a8-e55314fe6e41"],
 " as the onset of severe congestion. On a tandem of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["n", TraditionalForm]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Times",ExpressionUUID->
  "3604ff3d-d31c-4322-b423-9411d8b69907"],
 " signalised intersections along a corridor we approximate total delay by \
summing per-intersection delays \[LongDash] a Jackson-network-style \
approximation that ignores platoon-preservation between signals but is \
accurate enough for first-pass planning. It's exactly wrong in one important \
case: when a queue at one junction backs up past the stop-line of the \
previous one (",
 StyleBox["spillback",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 "), the M/D/1 formula no longer applies because blocking breaks the Markov \
property. That's the regime where you have to switch to microsimulation."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f737181d-2d90-49d6-960b-0037f5a198ce"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
qRes = Queueing`SimulateQueueing[];
Queueing`PlotQueueing[qRes]\
\>", "Input",
 CellTags->"runnable",ExpressionUUID->"b6089278-4b9b-44bf-9744-e48536ab3c05"],

