Cell["\<\
On the curated 15-node Aberdeen network (Haudagain, Bridge of Don, Bridge of \
Dee, Union Street, Anderson Drive, AWPR junction, etc.) with 4 OD pairs \
summing to 8500 veh/h, the solver produces saturation levels that track \
real-world experience:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"53cb60b5-038a-435f-9a43-1263b5c58d86"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
abRes = AberdeenNetwork`SimulateAberdeenNetwork[];
AberdeenNetwork`PlotAberdeenNetwork[abRes]\
\>", "Input",
 CellTags->"runnable",ExpressionUUID->"9d887fe6-2152-4d24-ad3f-471bbb501369"],

